{"a":[1,9],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>Bu sûre dahi mekkîdir, hicretten mukaddem Mekkede nâzil olmuştur. bunda icma' vardır. Ancak Mukatil «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 135.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 16.4 16.4 24.0 30.7 30.7 38.2 54.0 54.0 64.4 82.4 82.4 91.4 91.4 99.7 99.7 106.4 113.2 124.4\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 24.0 64.4 106.4 113.2 124.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » den « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"340\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 340.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 20.3 27.0 27.0 33.7 33.7 33.7 42.0 42.0 58.6 58.6 67.6 67.6 76.6 76.6 84.7 93.0 93.0 101.3 101.3 120.7 120.7 131.3 131.3 147.0 153.7 161.3 161.3 177.0 188.3 188.3 188.3 195.0 210.7 210.7 221.3 221.3 237.0 253.6 253.6 253.6 260.3 277.6 298.6 305.3 314.3 314.3 321.7 321.7 328.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"20.3 27.0 147.0 153.7 195.0 237.0 260.3 277.6 286.6 286.6 298.6 328.6\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyetine kadar istisna etmiş, bunların medenî olduğunu söylemiştir. Bu, İbni Abbastan dahi rivayet edilmiş « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"125\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 124.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 33.0 33.0 40.6 56.3 63.0 69.7 69.7 76.6 83.3 99.0 99.0 106.6 106.6 113.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 63.0 76.6 83.3 113.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyetine kadar da denilmiştir. Anlaşılıyor ki böyle diyen gâyenin mugayyada duhulünü kasdetmiş, ya'ni «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"71\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 71.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.0 45.7 45.7 53.2 53.2 60.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 23.2 30.0 60.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nın istisnada dahıl ve medenî olduğunu göstermek istemiştir.</p><p>Âyetleri - Kûfiyyun ve Hıcaz ta'dadında iki yüz altı, Bısriyyun ve Şam ta'dadında iki yüz beştir. Tam âyet olub olmadığında rivayet muhtelif olanlar şunlardır: « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"444\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 444.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 14.3 21.0 39.0 50.3 50.3 57.0 69.0 69.0 81.7 81.7 89.3 105.0 116.3 116.3 116.3 124.6 131.3 131.3 138.0 145.6 161.3 171.7 171.7 187.6 194.3 194.3 201.0 201.0 207.7 207.7 230.3 241.6 241.6 252.0 260.3 260.3 267.7 276.0 276.0 282.7 298.6 298.6 307.6 307.6 318.7 325.6 334.6 350.3 357.0 366.0 386.3 397.6 397.6 397.6 417.7 417.7 426.7 426.7 434.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.0 57.0 131.3 161.3 241.6 282.7 318.7 325.6 334.6 357.0 366.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"96\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 96.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 20.3 27.0 27.0 33.7 41.3 52.6 52.6 68.3 79.6 79.6 79.6 86.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 33.7 41.3 86.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> »</p><p>Kelimatı - «Otuz üç bin yirmi beştir».</p><p>Hurufu - «On dört bin üç yüz ondur».</p><p>Fasılaları - «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 10.6 21.8 32.3 43.6 50.3 61.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » harfleridir. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"31\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 30.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 20.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » yalnız baştaki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 49.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 23.3 32.3 39.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dadır. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"24\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » yalnız ahiri «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 20.3 27.0 33.7 41.3 52.6 52.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 33.7 41.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » olandır ki iki âyettedir. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 28.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 12.0 18.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » on kadardır. Mütebakisi hep «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"32\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 31.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 21.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dur. « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"111\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 111.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 11.3 18.0 18.0 24.7 32.3 48.0 58.6 58.6 74.3 81.0 81.0 87.7 87.7 94.6 94.6\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"18.0 48.0\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Bir âyet nihayeti olduğu rivayetine göre bir de «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 14.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » fasılası var demektir.</p><p>İsimleri - Sûretül'araf, Sûretülmîkat, Sûretülmîsak, Elif lâm mim saddır. « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"275\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 275.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 13.4 20.2 32.2 32.2 49.4 49.4 67.4 74.2 81.7 81.7 90.7 95.2 102.7 118.4 129.7 136.4 145.4 162.7 162.7 162.7 179.2 186.0 198.7 198.7 219.7 226.4 235.4 235.4 243.7 250.4 250.4 257.2 264.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"20.2 74.2 90.7 129.7 136.4 145.4 186.0 226.4 243.7 257.2 264.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ilh... diye Cennet ile Cehennem beyninde bir sur olan A'rafin ve eshabı A'rafın zikrini mütezammın olduğundan dolayı Sûretüla'raf, « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"185\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 184.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 36.7 43.6 43.6 52.6 52.6 69.0 80.3 91.6 99.7 99.7 115.6 122.3 122.3 129.0 150.0 156.7 156.7 165.7 173.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 30.0 80.3 115.6 129.0 156.7 165.7 173.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyeti ile Miykati Musâyı ve « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 178.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 14.3 14.3 21.0 36.7 43.6 51.7 51.7 59.3 66.0 81.7 81.7 81.